@startuml
[*] --> Accessing the System

Accessing the System --> Searching for Media : User initiates search
Accessing the System --> Organizing Media : User starts organizing
Accessing the System --> Sharing Media : User shares content
Accessing the System --> Getting Recommendations : User requests recommendations

Searching for Media --> Organizing Media : User decides to organize results
Searching for Media --> Sharing Media : User decides to share results
Searching for Media --> Accessing the System : Search completed

Organizing Media --> Sharing Media : User decides to share organized content
Organizing Media --> Accessing the System : Organization completed

Sharing Media --> Accessing the System : Sharing completed

Getting Recommendations --> Accessing the System : Recommendations displayed

Accessing the System --> [*] : User exits system
@enduml
